| DOCX text is 10× too large | Used `ptToTwip` (×20) for `TextRun.size` | Use `ptToHalfPt` (×2) for font sizes |
| PDF text overlaps horizontal rule | Used `y += 4` after `doc.line()` | Use `y += lineHeight` after any rule |
